icularly to the swordfish, once again)Numerous fixesSeveral new languagesEach key change is detailed below. Once again, thank you to everyone who has played the demo so far (more than 13k people have launched it) and helped us rep","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-07T20:38:39Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067927519","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:44:49Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2958550-1834602721187177","game_id":"steam-2958550","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo feedback & 0.5.0 Main changes","summary":"Hello everyone!First of all, we want to thank everyone who took the time to play the demo and share feedback with us.Overall, we think the demo went quite well, but we know it's not perfect. We've gathered a lot of valuable feedback and suggestions from players, and we've identified a few key areas that need improvement.Here are the main changes that come with 0.5.0 update :SwordfishThe Swordfish was originally designed to test whether players had learned how to use grapples effectively before p","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-04T11:00:33Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1834602721187177","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:44:49Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2958550-1832700592797902","game_id":"steam-2958550","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo available","summary":"Hello everyone!We're happy to announce that the demo is now available. We hope you will like it and would love to hear your thoughts and feedback.Enjoy four first dive!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-18T10:38:52Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1832700592797902","verifi